s($,"bs2","b8P",()=>A.b2n("A\xc7IK RIZA METN\u0130\n\n\xd6mer Karsl\u0131o\u011flu (TREKLY) taraf\u0131ndan a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki i\u015flemler i\xe7in \xf6zg\xfcr irademle a\xe7\u0131k r\u0131za veriyorum:\n\n1. Olu\u015fturdu\u011fum veya fork\u2019lad\u0131\u011f\u0131m rotalar\u0131n noktalar\u0131n\u0131n, ad\u0131n\u0131n, a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131n\u0131n, foto\u011fraflar\u0131m\u0131n, yorumlar\u0131m\u0131n ve puanlar\u0131m\u0131n di\u011fer kullan\u0131c\u0131lara g\xf6sterilmesi.\n2. Rota \xe7izerken ve y\xfcr\xfcy\xfc\u015f s\u0131ras\u0131nda cihaz konumumun i\u015flenmesi.\n3. Hesab\u0131m, rotalar\u0131m ve foto\u011fraflar\u0131m\u0131n, sunucular\u0131 T\xfcrkiye d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda olabilen Supabase altyap\u0131s\u0131na aktar\u0131lmas\u0131.\n4. Google Maps\u2019te a\xe7may\u0131 se\xe7ti\u011fim rotan\u0131n noktalar\u0131n\u0131n, yaln\u0131zca o a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fla s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 olarak Google\u2019a iletilmesi.\n\nR\u0131zam\u0131 diledi\u011fim zaman geri alabilirim. Geri alma, daha \xf6nce herkese a\xe7t\u0131\u011f\u0131m bir rotay\u0131 silmemle uygulan\u0131r. R\u0131zaya dayanmayan ve \xfcyeli\u011fin s\xfcrd\xfcr\xfclmesi i\xe7in zorunlu olan hesap kayd\u0131, bu geri almayla kendili\u011finden silinmez. Silinmesini ayr\u0131ca isteyebilirim.\n\nBu kutu \xf6nceden i\u015faretli de\u011fildir. \u0130\u015faretlemeden \xfcyelik tamamlanmaz. Bu r\u0131za, ayd\u0131nlatma metnini okudu\u011fum anlam\u0131na gelmez. Ayd\u0131nlatma metni ayr\u0131ca sunulur.\n","AYDINLATMA METN\u0130\n\nBu metin, 6698 say\u0131l\u0131 Ki\u015fisel Verilerin Korunmas\u0131 Kanunu\u2019nun 10. maddesi kapsam\u0131nda haz\u0131rlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Ayd\u0131nlatma, a\xe7\u0131k r\u0131zan\u0131n yerine ge\xe7mez.\n\nVeri sorumlusu: \xd6mer Karsl\u0131o\u011flu (TREKLY).\nBa\u015fvuru kanal\u0131: https://github.com/omerkarslioglu\n\n\u0130\u015flenen veriler\n\u2022 \xdcyelik: kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131, g\xf6r\xfcnen ad, e-posta. \u015eifre Supabase Auth i\xe7inde tutulur. Uygulama \u015fifreyi d\xfcz metin olarak saklamaz.\n\u2022 Payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z i\xe7erik: rota ad\u0131, a\xe7\u0131klama, \xfclke, \u015fehir, y\xfcr\xfcy\xfc\u015f tarihi, rota noktalar\u0131 (enlem ve boylam), foto\u011fraflar, yorumlar, puanlar ve \u201cy\xfcr\xfcd\xfcm\u201d kay\u0131tlar\u0131.\n\u2022 Konum: rotay\u0131 \xe7izerken veya y\xfcr\xfcy\xfc\u015f s\u0131ras\u0131nda, bu \xf6zelli\u011fi siz kullan\u0131rken cihaz\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n konumu.\n\u2022 Cihaz\u0131n\u0131zdaki tercihler: dil, karanl\u0131k mod ve oturum bilgisi. Bunlar sunucuya hesap kayd\u0131 olarak gitmez.\n\nAma\xe7lar ve hukuki sebep\n\u2022 Hesab\u0131n a\xe7\u0131lmas\u0131 ve giri\u015f (Kanun m.5/2-c, s\xf6zle\u015fmenin kurulmas\u0131 ve ifas\u0131).\n\u2022 Olu\u015fturdu\u011funuz veya fork\u2019lad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z rotan\u0131n, foto\u011fraflar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n ve konum izinizin di\u011fer kullan\u0131c\u0131lara g\xf6sterilmesi (Kanun m.5/1, a\xe7\u0131k r\u0131za).\n\u2022 Y\xfcr\xfcy\xfc\u015f s\u0131ras\u0131nda konumun kullan\u0131lmas\u0131 (Kanun m.5/1, a\xe7\u0131k r\u0131za).\n\u2022 Bu verilerin, sunucusu T\xfcrkiye d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda olabilen altyap\u0131ya aktar\u0131lmas\u0131 (Kanun m.5/1 ve m.9, a\xe7\u0131k r\u0131za).\n\u2022 Hizmetin g\xfcvenli\u011fi ve hatan\u0131n giderilmesi (Kanun m.5/2-f, me\u015fru menfaat; temel haklar\u0131n\u0131za zarar vermemek kayd\u0131yla).\n\nAktar\u0131lan taraflar\n\u2022 Supabase: hesap, veritaban\u0131 ve foto\u011fraf dosyalar\u0131. Sunucular T\xfcrkiye d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda olabilir.\n\u2022 GitHub Pages: uygulaman\u0131n kendisini yay\u0131nlar. Rota veriniz bu sitede saklanmaz.\n\u2022 OpenStreetMap karo sunucusu: harita g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfclenirken IP adresiniz bu sunucuya gider.\n\u2022 Google: yaln\u0131zca bir rotay\u0131 Google Maps\u2019te a\xe7arsan\u0131z. O anda rota noktalar\u0131 Google\u2019a iletilir.\n\nToplama y\xf6ntemi\nVeriler uygulama formlar\u0131, cihaz konumu ve taray\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n yerel deposu \xfczerinden toplan\u0131r.\n\nHaklar\u0131n\u0131z (Kanun m.11)\nVerinizin i\u015flenip i\u015flenmedi\u011fini \xf6\u011frenme, i\u015flenmi\u015fse bilgi isteme, amac\u0131n\u0131 ve aktar\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 ki\u015fileri \xf6\u011frenme, eksik veya yanl\u0131\u015fsa d\xfczeltilmesini isteme, silinmesini veya yok edilmesini isteme, yap\u0131lan i\u015flemlerin aktar\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc ki\u015filere bildirilmesini isteme, m\xfcnhas\u0131ran otomatik analize itiraz etme ve zarar\u0131n giderilmesini talep etme haklar\u0131na sahipsiniz.\n\nBa\u015fvurunuz, Kanun m.13 uyar\u0131nca en ge\xe7 otuz g\xfcn i\xe7inde sonu\xe7land\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r. Ba\u015fvurunuz reddedilirse, yan\u0131t\u0131 yetersiz bulursan\u0131z veya s\xfcresi i\xe7inde cevap verilmezse Ki\u015fisel Verileri Koruma Kurulu\u2019na \u015fikayet edebilirsiniz.\n"))
s($,"bs1","b8O",()=>A.b2n("EXPLICIT CONSENT\n\nI freely give explicit consent to \xd6mer Karsl\u0131o\u011flu (TREKLY) for the following:\n\n1. Showing the points, title, and description of a route I create or fork, together with my photos, comments, and ratings, to other people.\n2. Processing my device location while I draw a route and during a walk.\n3. Transferring my account, routes, and photos to Supabase, whose servers may be outside Turkey.\n4. Sending the points of a route to Google, only for the moment I choose to open that route in Google Maps.\n\nI may withdraw this consent at any time. Withdrawal takes effect by deleting a route I have already published. It does not by itself delete the account record required to keep the membership. I can ask for that deletion separately.\n\nThis box is not ticked in advance. The account is not created until I tick it. This consent does not mean I have read the privacy notice. The notice is shown separately. The Turkish text is the one that applies.\n","PRIVACY NOTICE\n\nThis notice is provided under Article 10 of Turkish Law No. 6698 on the Protection of Personal Data. The notice does not replace explicit consent. The Turkish text is the one that applies.\n\nData controller: \xd6mer Karsl\u0131o\u011flu (TREKLY).\nRequests: https://github.com/omerkarslioglu\n\nData we process\n\u2022 Account: username, display name, email. The password stays in Supabase Auth. The app does not store it as plain text.\n\u2022 What you share: route title, description, country, city, walk date, route points (latitude and longitude), photos, comments, ratings, and \u201cI walked this\u201d marks.\n\u2022 Location: your device location while you draw a route or while a walk is in progress, and only while you use that feature.\n\u2022 Preferences on the device: language, dark mode, and the session. These are not stored as the account record.\n\nPurposes and legal basis\n\u2022 Opening the account and signing in (Article 5/2-c, the membership contract).\n\u2022 Showing a route you create or fork, your photos, and the location trace to other people (Article 5/1, explicit consent).\n\u2022 Using location during a walk (Article 5/1, explicit consent).\n\u2022 Sending this data to infrastructure that may be hosted outside Turkey (Articles 5/1 and 9, explicit consent).\n\u2022 Keeping the service secure and fixing faults (Article 5/2-f, legitimate interest, without harming your fundamental rights).\n\nRecipients\n\u2022 Supabase, for the account, the database, and photo files. Its servers may be outside Turkey.\n\u2022 GitHub Pages, which serves the app. Your routes are not stored there.\n\u2022 The OpenStreetMap tile server, which receives your IP address when the map is shown.\n\u2022 Google, only if you open a route in Google Maps. The route points are sent to Google for that request.\n\nHow data is collected\nThrough the app forms, device location, and the browser\u2019s local storage.\n\nYour rights (Article 11)\nYou may ask whether your data is processed, request information, learn the purpose and the recipients, ask for a correction, ask for deletion or destruction, ask that those steps be told to the recipients, object to a decision based only on automated analysis, and claim compensation for damage.\n\nA request is answered within thirty days under Article 13. If it is refused, the answer is insufficient, or the time passes, you may complain to the Personal Data Protection Board.\n"))
